This is part of the project that is not required for proper working of the device itself but rather
cool addition. Its code that evolves from idea of foot switch which is documented in 3DprintedParts/doc.
Code is writen for ATtiny13a to accumulate potentiometers data and send it via MIDI or UART in this
context its basically the same. So you will have three ways for using this device gui interface, MIDI automation
or this foot switch. Its cheap as it gets because its literally required only three potentiometers, cabals, three buttons,
attiny and small Oled.
